{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993930867696001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"dull-strife-sigma","assignee":null,"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":3},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1781626712060154000,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"490a3d00-bd82-4d06-bae8-d933dff1860c","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"60ce-29c1-58be-4648"},{"link_uuid":"18603c4d-da4b-4184-b43d-7134f949848d","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c1bf-475a-5bbc-4976"}],"description":"## Context\nFrom the interactive env-var review (story 60ce). SESSION_ID is read in _commands/transition.py to tag event provenance: session = SESSION_ID (ambient, e.g. CI/agent session) or short git HEAD or \"unknown\". It is intentionally a GENERIC, externally-set var (NOT rebar-namespaced), so renaming to REBAR_SESSION_ID would lose the ambient pickup. Kept AS-IS for now pending a design decision.\n\n## Open questions\n- Should provenance read an ambient SESSION_ID, a rebar-owned REBAR_SESSION_ID, or both (ambient fallback)?\n- Collision risk: SESSION_ID is very generic and may be set by unrelated tooling.\n- Does it belong in the config surface at all, or is it pure runtime provenance?\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] EXPLICIT USER APPROVAL REQUIRED before any change to SESSION_ID handling (do not act autonomously)\n- [ ] Decision recorded: keep ambient / rename / support both\n- [ ] If changed: alias + docs + tests","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","c1bf-475a-5bbc-4976"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"83f2-f978-a8b4-4191","ticket_type":"task","title":"Decide SESSION_ID env-var disposition (reads ambient external session id)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f978de16-d246-4713-80b4-c0b8d682da85","490a3d00-bd82-4d06-bae8-d933dff1860c","18603c4d-da4b-4184-b43d-7134f949848d"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993930867696001,"uuid":"2524f15a-60f1-426a-8291-4af605d30de8"}